BT 1 0 0 1 0 151.0 Tm 11.4 TL /F3 8.6 Tf .121569 .121569 .121569 rg (I want to build a small web app: [ONE-SENTENCE PITCH].) Tj  T* (Interview me with the AskUserQuestion tool in one round of 3-4 multiple-choice questions:) Tj  T* (who uses it, the one main thing it stores, and the one action users do most.) Tj  T* (Mark a recommended option. Then write SPEC.md, scoped so v1 can be built in 90 minutes:) Tj  T* (- One main screen and one Supabase table. No login, no payments.) Tj  T* (- Stack: Vite + React + JavaScript, Supabase JS client.) Tj  T* (Break the build into these phases, each ending in something I can run:) Tj  T* (1. Scaffold the app) Tj  T* (2. Core screen with fake data) Tj  T* (3. Read data from Supabase) Tj  T* (4. Write data to Supabase) Tj  T* (5. Deploy) Tj  T* (For each phase, list acceptance criteria as a checklist.) Tj  T* (At the end, show the Supabase table you plan: column names, types, and which are required.) Tj T* ET
